// Retrieval latency by Provider (p50, p95, p99)
// Which Provider is slowest? The "Query the Search Index" span is the retrieval step only: no
// embeddings call, no ranking. Every Provider makes one, tagged meepleledger.provider.
//
// Internal spans (and Redis's Client span) land in AppDependencies, not AppRequests. Custom span
// attributes land in Properties (customDimensions in the classic Application Insights schema) as
// strings, so they are pulled out with tostring() before they can be grouped by.
AppDependencies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where Name == "Query the Search Index"
| extend Provider = tostring(Properties["meepleledger.provider"])
| summarize
    Queries = count(),
    p50 = percentile(DurationMs, 50),
    p95 = percentile(DurationMs, 95),
    p99 = percentile(DurationMs, 99)
    by Provider
| order by p95 desc
